# Culprit does NOT read API keys from a .env file at runtime.
#
# The user enters their own key in Settings → AI assist, and it is stored in
# the iOS keychain via flutter_secure_storage. Nothing is bundled into the
# app binary and nothing is committed to this repository.
#
# This file exists only to document that fact, and to give the .gitignore
# rule something to point at. If you add tooling that needs a key for local
# scripting, copy this to `.env` (which is gitignored) — never commit it.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
